the CBOR-encoded signature field is hashed using SHA-256 to create
   the following TimeStampReq object

   SEQUENCE {
     INTEGER 1
     SEQUENCE {
       SEQUENCE {
         OBJECT IDENTIFIER sha-256 (2 16 840 1 101 3 4 2 1)
         NULL
         }
       OCTET STRING
         44 C2 41 9D 13 1D 53 D5 55 84 B5 DD 33 B7 88 C2
         4E 55 1C 6D 44 B1 AF C8 B2 B8 5E 69 54 76 3B 4E
       }
     BOOLEAN TRUE
     }

   The TimeStampToken shown in the TSTInfo excerpt that follows, and
   embedded in the final COSE_Sign1 under label 270, must be re-obtained
   from the TSA for this MessageImprint; its
   TSTInfo.messageImprint.hashedMessage must then read
   44 C2 41 9D ... 54 76 3B 4E as well.
